# Only the Middle Gene Changes

@body

Here the alleles are arranged in *map order: F-W-P*.

| Type | F | W | P | Count |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| Parent | f | + | + | 569 |
| DCO | f | [*w*]{background-color=#8FABFF} | + | 23 |
| Parent | + | w | p | 565 |
| DCO | + | [*+*]{background-color=#8FABFF} | p | 31 |

The outside alleles stay together; the middle allele changes.
In the homework's F/P/W columns, the DCO types are *f+w* and *+p+*.

